sequenceDiagram
actor Keeper as "Warehouse Keeper"
actor Retailer
participant UI as "Interface: UI"
participant Pick as "pickingService: Service"
participant Ship as "shipmentService: Service"
participant Complaint as "complaintService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
Keeper->>UI: Report QR mismatch, damage or shortage
UI->>+Pick: flagException(pickingCode, reason)
Pick->>DB: Mark picking/shipment NeedsHandling
Pick-->>-UI: Exception recorded
Retailer->>UI: Confirm received QR quantities or report discrepancy
UI->>Ship: confirmReceipt() or createComplaint()
alt Receipt matches
    Ship->>DB: Save receipt confirmation and close shipment when all labels received
else Discrepancy
    UI->>Complaint: submit shipment-linked complaint
    Complaint->>DB: Save evidence and disputed quantity/value
end
Note over Complaint,DB: No automatic return stock restoration or partial delivery is introduced


